# Troll Negotiations resolves for what is still legal (CR 608.2b). First cast: Bot1's Ornithopter and Bot2's first Ornithopter; Bot2
# answers with a Lightning Bolt on its own Ornithopter, so the counters are still put on Bot1's Ornithopter (a 2/4) and nothing
# fights. Second cast: Bot1's Grizzly Bears and Bot2's second Ornithopter; Bot2 Bolts the Bears, so no counters are put and
# nothing fights - the second Ornithopter is not harmed.

